 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by authorities in the market, analysts say.  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 South Korea\b0 \highlight\uc2 's foreign reserves ($ billion):   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  end-Feb   end-Jan   end-Dec   end-Nov   end-Oct  end-Sept\par  215.950   216.933   210.391   208.230   207.307   206.731\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 ECONOMY-KOREA-RESERVES (URGENT)|LANGEN|Table|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|ABX  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020060302e23200236\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
