\par\par \b \uc2 S Korea Govt Aide: \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  Mkt  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Unavoidable-Report  \b0\par\par\uc2 243 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 Januar 2006\par 06:29\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 SEOUL (Dow Jones)--A senior official from \b \highlight22\uc2 South Korea\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  and Economy said Tuesday that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market is unavoidable, reported online news provider edaily.  \par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market has a 'zero-sum game' structure, but it has the tendency to go one-sided because of a small group of participants... That's why the government has to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Kwon Tae-Kyun, director-general of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  and Economy's international finance bureau, was quoted as saying. [ 31-01-06 0539GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 "There are about 56 participants in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, and about 20-30 are active participants, so they all know who bought at what level... this is how the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market differs from the equity market," edaily reported Kwon as saying.  \par \par \uc2 "These participants conduct short-term day trading, ignoring government's policy on liberalizing \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading or its mid- to long-term \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market measures."  \par \par \uc2 Kwon said in the edaily that stability in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is important, regardless of what level it is at, because Asian countries have now begun to discuss the introduction of a joint \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , like the euro.  \par \par \uc2 The local media has quoted Kwon as saying the joint \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be implemented in 10 to 15 years.  \par \par \uc2 -By Seoul Bureau; Dow Jones Newswires; 822-732-2165; djnews.seoul@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Gauri Bhatia [ 31-01-06 0620GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020060131e21v0005h\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
