omy.  \par \par \uc2 The reserves had hit a record $206.82 billion on March 15, a rise attributed to official \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to curb the won's strength.  \par \par \uc2 South Korean foreign reserves ($ billion):  \par \par \uc2 Mid-May End-April End-March End-Feb End-Jan End-Dec  \par \par \uc2 205.759 206.376 205.447 202.162 199.699 199.066  \par \par \uc2 ECONOMY-KOREA-\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2  (URGENT)|LANGEN|Table|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|ABX  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050516e15g00284\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
