\par\par \b \uc2 Emerging Asia  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 -Won jumps - baht, sing dollar gain.  \b0\par\par\uc2 712 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Februar 2005\par 03:28\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     SINGAPORE, Feb 28 (Reuters) - The South Korean won jumped\par three-quarters of a percent on Monday to lead gains in Asian\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , after industrial production for January beat\par expectations and boosted the region's stock markets.\par     The won                  strengthened to a high of 1,001\par per dollar in local trade, short of last week's seven-year high\par of 998.1. Data showed South Korea's factory output rose a\par faster-than-expected 3.1 percent in January from December.\par     Analysts said \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 South Korea\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  may sell more bonds to fund\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to halt the won's gains. The won, which\par was 2004's best performing \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in Asia, has retained that\par position this year having gained 3.2 percent.\par  "We think (\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ) is possible if the won continues to\par straighten rapidly," Irene Cheung, head of Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par strategy at ABN AMRO Bank in Singapore, said in a report.\par     The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  concerns may keep the won from breaching\par the 1,000 won per dollar barrier in the near term.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Still, South\par Korea's strong balance of payment flows pointed to an\par appreciation bias for the won, Cheung said.\par  The South Korean data was followed by statistics from Japan\par which showed industrial production rose a faster-than-expected\par 2.1 percent in January from a month earlier.\par  \par     The two data bolstered expectations that two of Asia's\par biggest economies were recovering from a domestic slowdown.\par     The yen        gained as much as half a percent from late\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Asian trading on Friday to 104.60 per dollar. The Singapore\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dollar , which closely tracks the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of Japan,\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par South Korea and Taiwan, gained a quarter of a percent to\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     Taiwan's markets were closed for a holiday on Monday.\par     SURGING STOCKS\par     The optimism about a revival in South Korea has attracted\par overseas investors to its stock markets this month, pushing its\par benchmark stock index to a five-year high on Monday.\par     Foreign investors have bought a net 2.04 trillion won in\par shares so far this year. In Taiwan, foreigners have been net\par buyers of local stocks on all but one day in February.\par     The baht        gained a quarter of a percent to 38.30 per\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dollar on expectations the Bank of Thailand may raise its\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par benchmark rate on Wednesday. Thai real interest rates, a\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par measure that takes into account inflation, are lower than in\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the U.S.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Cheung expects the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to raise the rate by a quarter\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     "The expectation of modest tightening in the coming months\par should help underpin the baht," she said.\par     Premiums on non-deliverable yuan forwards (NDF) extended\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par their gains after a Chinese \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  regulator said\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par that the country would gradually ease the amount of yuan that\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par can be exchanged under the capital account.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The official said such a move would take the country\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par another step closer towards full convertibility of the yuan.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The Chinese \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is now convertible for trade purposes.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The premium on the one-year yuan NDF, which investors use\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par to bet on any change in the value of the tightly controlled\par   \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , rose to price in a 4.7 percent appreciation on\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Monday, from 4.5 percent on Friday. The premium has been rising\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par for the past two weeks.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Traders are also watching India's annual budget statement\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par due later on Monday for details of the government's efforts to\par   \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CURRENCIES\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VS U.S. DOLLAR  Change on the day at   0148 GMT\par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid   Previous day    Pct Move\par  Japan yen       104.72         105.18       +0.44\par  Sing dlr        1.6271         1.6309       +0.23\par  Korean won     1004.20        1008.30       +0.41\par  Baht             38.31          38.40       +0.23\par  Peso             54.65          54.76       +0.20\par  Rupiah         9260.00        9258.00       -0.02 Change on\par year\par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid  End prev year    Pct Move\par  Japan yen       104.72         102.45       -2.17\par  Sing dlr        1