ar \par \uc2 \f2 But the won has gained 12 percent against the U.S. dollar so far this year, outperforming other \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , like the Japanese yen , which has advanced 2 percent, and the euro , which has gained 6 percent against the dollar.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020041215e0cf0069c\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
